  "description": "The Kinesis 4S Apex is now half price at £845, down from £1,700, while stocks last.\nThe 4S name says it all: Four Seasons. This is a road bike designed to be ridden and enjoyed all year round, not stored when the weather turns. It comes ready for real UK riding, with full mudguards already fitted, a carbon fork, SRAM Apex gears, full hydraulic disc brakes and slightly flared bars that give extra control on rougher roads or loaded with a bar bag on longer days out.\nThe SRAM 1x drivetrain keeps things simple. One chainring, less to adjust, less to go wrong. Its wide gear range handles steep climbs and fast descents without fuss, and the editors at road.cc found that after testing it on their regular routes, the ride position of the 4S bike is comfortable enough to pay dividends on longer rides and would be their choice for daily commuting or year-round use.\nBuilt around a lightweight double-butted 6061 aluminium frame and Kinesis Rider Fit Geometry, the 4S works across four sizes and is sized to fit a wider range of riders than many bikes at this price.\nAvailable in Silver Mist. Direct from Kinesis only. Cannot be purchased with promotion codes.",
